    "landing.proVoiceTitle": "Make room for the whole conversation.",
    "landing.proVoiceBody": "Get more voice translation minutes with Pro. Two-way captions and spoken translations help you follow check-in questions, directions and the details that come next.",
    "landing.proKnowledgeTitle": "Set it up for the way you work.",
    "landing.proKnowledgeBody": "Save up to 5 custom knowledge profiles for your work, studies or everyday situations. Give each its own instructions, so you can spend less time explaining your preferences.",
    "landing.proWidgetTitle": "Learn at your own pace.",
    "landing.proWidgetBody": "Customize learning Widget content, topics and difficulty with Pro. Review work vocabulary on your commute or travel phrases before a trip, right on your Home Screen.",
    "landing.proNote": "Download free and start translating. Choose Pro in the App; prices, voice allowances and renewal terms are shown before purchase.",
    "landing.proCta": "Start free. Explore Pro in the App.",
    "landing.ctaAccent": "You'll know where to start.",
    "landing.menuLabel": "Menu scan",
    "landing.agentLabel": "Voice Agent · Conversation assistant",
    "landing.helperTitle": "Helper: understand the words behind the translation.",
    "landing.helperBody": "Open explanations alongside a translation to explore vocabulary, grammar, examples and cultural context. Use Helper when a literal meaning is clear but you still need to know how a phrase is used. Custom knowledge profiles let you tailor these explanations to your interests and learning needs.",
    "landing.historyTitle": "History: return to what you have translated.",
    "landing.historyBody": "Reopen saved translations to check a phrase, revisit a conversation or review what you learned. Smart Scan also keeps organized scans, and Voice Agent keeps conversation and confirmation records on the device so you can revisit the details."
